1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,940
They don't understand what we've got going on

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:08,340
Say you're bad for my body, say you do me wrong

3
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:11,860
They don't see the way you fight for me inside

4
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:16,500
They don't know you're the reason I'm still alive

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,980
So I keep coming back, baby, right on time

6
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:25,620
Every other week

7
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:29,780
You know I'm yours, and you're mine

8
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:33,220
You left a little something up beneath my skin

9
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:37,300
A little door above my heart to let you in

10
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:41,620
Got me up all night, and I'm losing my hair

11
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:45,380
And I'd be lying if I told you I don't care

12
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:48,900
But you're worth every stumble, every fall I take

13
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:53,380
'Cause I'm waking up each morning, and that's the deal we made

14
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:54,140
That little machine starts beeping soft and low
